OL,3,GNEWSAPupils struggling with school
OL,4,Aclosure, parents say
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents whose private school closed
OL,7,Fshortly before the summer holidays are
OL,8,Fstruggling with their transition to new
OL,9,Fschools, their parents have said.
OL,11,FDurham High School shut at the end of
OL,12,Flast term with the company running it,
OL,13,FDurham Education Ltd, going into
OL,14,Fadministration and the 14-acre site
OL,15,Fbeing put up for sale.
OL,17,FParents were not told until July, with
OL,18,Fdirector Yan Gao previously saying the
OL,19,Foperator was "deeply sorry" for its
OL,20,Fclosure.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
