OL,3,GNEWSAPupils struggling with school
OL,4,Aclosure, parents say
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne parent said their nine-year-old
OL,7,Fdaughter was still looking for a new
OL,8,Fschool place, with another saying their
OL,9,F16-year-old had lost confidence after
OL,10,Fbeing separated from friends and staff.
